Changes from Hirte include the rename to Bergr, the agent chat view for Claude Code,
Codex and Antigravity (bergr/Chat), two-pane layout on iPad, SSH over Network framework,
end-to-end encrypted push alerts (bergr-notify and the relay in relay/), and the demo content. See the git history for the full list of changes.
